  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Kootenayscolex barbarensis. Body thickness, color, posture and exact bristle counts are interpretations. ROM artwork is an interpretive comparison, not fossil preservation of color. No microgeometry mandate: count simplification must be explicit.",
